  "created": "2026-09-08T19:37:16.657Z",
  "description": "Sets the host environment name of a .NET MAUI app, so IHostEnvironment.IsDevelopment() means something.\nMAUI registers a host environment of its own, but it always reports Production and its EnvironmentName setter throws. This wraps it.",
  "iconFile": "me.png",
  "id": "Me.Toolkit.Maui.Hosting",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-08T20:03:50.06Z",
